      "text": [
        "2174 - وَ رُوِيَ : «أَنَّهُ إِذَا أَخَذَ اَلنَّاسُ مَنَازِلَهُمْ بِمِنًى نَادَاهُمْ مُنَادٍ لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ بِفِنَاءِ مَنْ حَلَلْتُمْ لَأَيْقَنْتُمْ بِالْخَلَفِ بَعْدَ اَلْمَغْفِرَةِ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2174 - It has been narrated: \"When the people take their places at Mina, a caller announces to them: 'If you knew in whose presence you have settled, you would be certain of receiving abundance after forgiveness.'\""
